   "wordStart": 24,
   "wordEnd": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "Lift something heavy.",
   "start": 13.13,
   "end": 14.13,
   "wordStart": 25,
   "wordEnd": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "Eat real food.",
   "start": 14.869,
   "end": 16.029,
   "wordStart": 28,
   "wordEnd": 30
  },
  {
   "text": "Guard your sleep.",
   "start": 16.909,
   "end": 18.089,
   "wordStart": 31,
   "wordEnd": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "Everything runs on rest.",
   "start": 19.109,
   "end": 20.609,
   "wordStart": 34,
   "wordEnd": 37
  },
  {
   "text": "Your body is the only place you have to live.",
